OL,3,GNEWSA'My dream career started here':
OL,4,ACostume designers protest degree
OL,5,Aclosure
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrom the stately homes of Downtown
OL,8,FAbbey to modern Scottish films such as
OL,9,FSunshine on Leith, costume designer
OL,10,FAnna Mary Scott Robbins has worked hard
OL,11,Fto reach the top of her profession.
OL,13,FBut she credits the degree she studied
OL,14,Fat Edinburgh College of Art with giving
OL,15,Fher the ability to get a foothold in
OL,16,Fthe industry.
OL,18,F"I've been very dedicated in pursuing
OL,19,Fmy ambition but my career would look
OL,20,Fvery different if I hadn't started with
OL,21,Fmy studies at ECA," she told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
